## Proposed Changes

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start(["auto_pipeline.sh invoked (Manual or CRON)"]) --> LockCheck{"Acquire PID Lock?<br/>(logs/auto_pipeline.lock)"}
    LockCheck -- "Already Running" --> ExitLock["Exit 0 immediately (Avoid GPU collision)"]
    LockCheck -- "Acquired" --> CleanMineru["Pre-flight: Clean 0-byte files in mineru/in/"]
    
    CleanMineru --> CheckBacklog{"Backlog in mineru/out or TTS_Script/out?"}
    CheckBacklog -- Yes --> DrainBacklog["Run Stage 2 & Stage 3 on Backlog"]
    CheckBacklog -- No --> CheckIn{"PDFs in in/ ?"}
    DrainBacklog --> CheckIn
    
    CheckIn -- "No PDFs in in/" --> Summary["Print Summary, Release Lock, Exit 0"]
    CheckIn -- "Found PDFs" --> PickOne["Pick next PDF from in/<br/>(Validate file stability & %PDF header)"]
    
    PickOne --> MoveToMineru["Move PDF -> mineru/in/"]
    MoveToMineru --> Stage1["Stage 1: mineru/batch_fast.sh"]
    
    Stage1 -- Success --> Stage2["Stage 2: TTS_Script/batch_fast.sh"]
    Stage1 -- Failure --> Quarantine1["Move PDF to failed/ & Log Error"]
    Quarantine1 --> NextBook{"More PDFs?"}
    
    Stage2 -- Success --> Stage3["Stage 3: chatterbox/batch_fast.sh<br/>(TTS .m4b + EPUB + AudioBookshelf Upload)"]
    Stage2 -- Failure --> Quarantine2["Log Stage 2 Failure"]
    Quarantine2 --> NextBook
    
    Stage3 -- Success --> HardlinkCompleted["Link mineru/completed/PDF -> completed/PDF"]
    Stage3 -- Failure --> Quarantine3["Log Stage 3 Failure"]
    
    HardlinkCompleted --> NextBook
    Quarantine3 --> NextBook
    NextBook -- Yes --> PickOne
    NextBook -- No --> Summary
```

