#### [NEW] [`cron_example.txt`](cron_example.txt)
Reference crontab example for running periodically (e.g. every 15 or 30 minutes, or nightly):
```cron
# Run audiobook conversion pipeline every 30 minutes
# Lockfile prevents duplicate runs if a previous conversion is still running.
*/30 * * * * /path/to/BookConverters/auto_pipeline.sh >> /path/to/BookConverters/logs/cron.log 2>&1
```

